          "It's a strip club. Drinks are overpriced, the music's loud, nobody's complained yet."
        ],
        "ask_about:drinks": [
          "Beer, spirits, whatever's in the well. Don't order anything with an umbrella."
        ],
        "ask_about:deacon": [
          "Deacon does the door. If he walks you out, don't argue. I've seen people argue."
        ],
        "ask_about:dancers": [
          "They work hard. Tip them, don't touch them, and we all get along."
        ],
